# UXC: I2C NACKs during the interrupt read, then the bus recovers.
chip ux
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
vidbg auto
src 1920 1080
call init
at 1100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 200 until 2000
at 2000
nack on
src 1280 720
int fall
at 3000
nack off
at 3500
int fall
at 2100
call mjpeg 1280 720 80 every 200 until 6000
at 6000
end
